# behavior: Unadmitted native calls, unsafe methods and constructors, owned foreign fields, unsafe callback storage, native calls without a selectable callee, numeric arguments that violate a parameterized Rust bound, method results with unfixed parameters, borrowed scalar callback returns, a later use that conflicts with the owner arguments a local's first use fixed, and an exclusive borrow of an immutable binding that holds a shared socket reference are refused (#2256, #2481)
